{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人黃敏碩於節目中推介海豐國際(1308)，一來內地外貿表現良好，上半年出口升17.6%，而公司主攻集裝箱航運及延伸物流，業務重心在亞洲區，受歐美影響較少，加上現價股息率逾8厘，對收息一族具吸引力。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2323.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026NVeCoR5mr11784615619.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2323.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">黃敏碩建議於現價、即約36.26元買入，目標價上望38.95元，若失守32.45元便止蝕。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海豐國際(1308)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$36.26</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$38.95</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$32.45</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2324.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/20267vv4mULzN91784615611.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2324.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">股評人伍禮賢推介金山軟件(3888)，指公司基本面不差，首季辦公軟件及服務收益按年升24%，海外付費用戶達285萬、升64%。表現較弱的遊戲業務方面，預料收益跌勢將見底，股價可望追落後。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2325.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026F7P85EAGVR1784615643.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2325.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">伍禮賢認為，股價已築成平台底部，現價24.82元可以吸納，目標價27元，止蝕價定於22元。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">金山軟件(3888)買賣策略</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">買入：$24.82</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">目標：$27</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">止蝕：$22</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"2326.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026PZyjOmLJst1784615662.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"2326.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T06:58:05.926724+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":370,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}